      "title": "Welcome to the Barking Grid Project",
      "narrative": "The Barking Grid Reinforcement is one of the network operator's most significant infrastructure investments planned for 2028. This tour will guide you through the project's scope, rationale, and impact on East London's electricity network. The project addresses growing demand from the Thames Freeport development and supports the region's ambitious decarbonisation targets.",
