      "id": "existing-infrastructure",
      "title": "Current Grid Infrastructure",
      "narrative": "The existing Barking Grid Substation, built in the 1960s, has served East London reliably for decades. However, aging assets and increasing load requirements mean substantial upgrades are needed. The 132kV network in this area connects multiple primary substations serving industrial, commercial, and residential customers across Barking, Dagenham, and surrounding areas.",
