    {
      "id": "investment-drivers",
      "title": "Why This Investment Is Needed",
      "narrative": "Three key factors drive this investment: First, asset condition - much of the existing switchgear dates from the 1960s and requires replacement. Second, load growth - the Thames Freeport development will add significant new demand for electricity. Third, renewable integration - new solar and battery storage connections require enhanced fault level management. Together, these factors make the Barking Grid reinforcement essential for maintaining reliable supply.",
