    {
      "id": "project-scope",
      "title": "Project Scope and Investment",
      "narrative": "The Barking Grid Reinforcement includes: installation of new 132kV Gas-Insulated Switchgear (GIS), two new 132/33kV 90MVA transformers, upgrade of protection and control systems, and new cable routes to adjacent substations. The total investment is approximately 45 million pounds, making it one of the largest single projects in the network operator's ED2 investment plan. Construction is scheduled to begin in 2027 with completion targeted for late 2028.",
