      "id": "future-benefits",
      "title": "Enabling East London's Future",
      "narrative": "Once complete, the Barking Grid Reinforcement will unlock significant capacity for growth: up to 200MW of additional demand can be connected, supporting thousands of new homes and businesses. The upgraded infrastructure will also enable faster connection of renewable generation and battery storage, supporting the UK's Net Zero targets. This investment demonstrates the network operator's commitment to building the electricity network that East London needs for the decades ahead.",
